    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18544997467b373842e99680",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌的师姐压低重心摆出架势……\n她散发出惊人的杀气，\n一步一步地逼近八重无敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e3320fc7283d34f3d719d760e6790e184853651a3f632a6b29637d3dc153a46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072704.json",
      "json_path": [
